    "parent": {
      "kind": "core-rule",
      "id": "units-and-models"
    },
    "summary": "A descriptor a rule gives a unit, such as **TERMINATOR**, hidden, **battle-shocked**, **visible** or controlling, fits the unit if at least 1 of its models fits it.\n\nThat does not give the rule to all of the unit’s models unless the rule says it grants it to the unit; then each model gains it, as Units and Models describes.",
